1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,450
One of the simplest side hustles is making something once, and selling it again and again.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,208
Think templates, planners, presets, printables, or short guides.

3
00:00:09,558 --> 00:00:14,447
Start with something you already know. A budget sheet, a workout plan, a study guide.

4
00:00:14,797 --> 00:00:19,719
List it on marketplaces like Etsy or Gumroad, where people are already searching.

5
00:00:20,069 --> 00:00:24,811
Be realistic. Most products sell slowly at first, and some never sell at all.

6
00:00:25,161 --> 00:00:28,678
Make a few, see which one gets interest, then make that one better.

7
00:00:29,028 --> 00:00:33,716
It won't replace your job overnight. But small sales can stack up over time.
